{
  "analysis": "The proof that was required at last shows itself to be in every way to the purpose. The two files that had been put to rights are found to have all the values in question made to give place to the appointed means of supply. The four such means of supply are to be seen to be in a state of entire agreement with one another in both of the files. The search that was made through the whole of the matter has on the other hand failed in every case to discover the values that it was set to discover. That state of things plainly shows that the whole undertaking has been brought to the end that was proposed in the first instance.",
  "plan": "There is now nothing further that it is necessary to do. The files that were not from the first in a condition to require any sort of change have in like manner been left in that same condition. The matter may therefore with every propriety be declared to have been brought to an end.",
  "task_complete": true
}
